  "blocks": {
    "\"Autocompact fired between turns — the early decisions got summarised and we must have lost something. Reload the plan doc, or compact manually next time so you control what gets kept.\"": "“自动压缩在两个<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/turn\">轮次</a>之间触发了——早期决定被放进摘要，我们肯定遗漏了什么。重新加载计划文档；下次手动压缩，这样你可以控制保留哪些内容。”",
    "\"It doesn't seem to remember what we decided about the schema earlier.\"": "“它似乎不记得我们之前对 schema 作出的决定了。”",
    "Compaction triggered automatically by the harness when the context window approaches full.": "当<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/context-window\">上下文窗口</a>接近满载时，由<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/harness\">运行框架</a>自动触发<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/compaction\">压缩</a>。",
    "Except something did happen. Compaction is lossy, and autocompact is lossy at a moment you didn't choose. A manual compact happens at a phase boundary, when you can tell the model what to preserve. Autocompact fires mid-task, whenever the threshold is hit — possibly halfway through a refactor, with the summary deciding for itself which of your decisions were worth keeping. The classic symptom: the agent carries on confidently but has quietly forgotten a constraint you established an hour ago, and you only notice when its work starts contradicting it.": "但实际上确实发生了变化。压缩本身是有损的，而自动压缩会在你没有选择的时刻造成损失。手动压缩可以在阶段边界执行，此时你还能告诉模型哪些内容必须保留；自动压缩则会在任务中途、每当达到阈值时触发——可能正好发生在重构进行到一半，摘要自行判断你作出的哪些决定值得保留。典型症状是：智能体继续自信地工作，却悄悄忘记了你一小时前确定的一项约束，直到它的工作开始与约束矛盾时你才发现。",
    "The defence is to not let it fire. Watch the context indicator and compact manually at a natural boundary, or write decisions into a plan doc or handoff artifact on disk, where no summary can lose them. Most harnesses also let you customise the buffer — moving the threshold earlier or later, or turning autocompact off entirely — so you can tune how much headroom you keep before it fires.": "防范办法是不要让它随意触发。观察上下文指示器，在自然边界手动压缩；或者把决策写入磁盘上的计划文档或<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/handoff-artifact\">交接产物</a>，这样摘要就无法遗漏。大多数运行框架还允许自定义缓冲区——提前或推后阈值，甚至完全关闭自动压缩——你可以据此调节触发前希望保留多少余量。",
    "The harness watches how full the context window is. When it crosses a threshold — often around 80% — it pauses, asks the model to summarise the session so far, and seeds a fresh session with the summary. Work then continues as if nothing happened.": "运行框架会监测上下文窗口的占用程度。当占用越过某个阈值——通常约为 80%——它会暂停，要求<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/model\">模型</a>总结当前<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/session\">会话</a>，再用摘要启动一个新会话。之后工作会继续进行，仿佛什么都没有发生。",
    "Usage:": "<em>用法：</em>"
  },
